    <title>没存Vol059_直面自己-建筑大师们如何设计自己的住宅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af95eb3a4a79edf137984c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af95eb3a4a79edf137984c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:35:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>设计狗</span></strong></p><p><span>大娃 老六</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>内容概要</span></strong></p><p><span>建筑师一生可能设计过很多住宅，但真正为自己设计的房子，往往最能暴露他的建筑理念。我们今天就来聊一聊建筑师为自己设计的房子，看看大师们是如何将自己的理念应用在自己的房子里的。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>把自住宅当成建筑实验室——赖特Taliesin与卒姆托的Haldenstein</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a>把住宅当成建筑师的个人宣言——密斯的范斯沃斯与巴拉甘的Casa Barragán</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a>建筑师直面自己的需求——柯布的Le Cabanon与盖里的Gehry Residence</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><p><span>Taliesin的转角玻璃</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkJ0b0_x6YsfombcAV5yHL4Eu2Z2.png"><p></p><ul><li><p><span>Taliesin的入口一角</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lg3BUCY_eaUII4mCElvJ2zWRhJ--.JPG"><p></p><ul><li><p><span>Taliesin的屋檐</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lp2ZVc-DJVDKz2-7YxSrWtjgITVZ.JPG"><p></p><ul><li><p><span>祖姆托的自住宅室内</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjZWtTWSFl7XIo0NccGI9skbZI3D.png"><p></p><ul><li><p><span>范斯沃斯住宅</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lt4_3HAi0BPxzFeY8vevTGD4zb2f.JPG"><ul><li><p><span>范斯沃斯住宅内部</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqy3itLNV99sSXz2Srhr9gGZ4HGY.JPG"><p></p><ul><li><p><span>巴拉干的自住宅</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqSkrRlPzfwb07cQ9yri-fezyQSL.png"><ul><li><p><span>巴拉干的自住宅室内</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnOg_6XV40i-SKlIfTHSIj5VyqGh.png"><p></p><ul><li><p><span>柯布西耶的Le Cabanon 平面</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl4pax8gAwrQx9-rf0jk9sL2NVVD.png"><p></p><ul><li><p><span>柯布西耶的Le Cabanon 室内</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrEKhwOjs_iSOJfJBenZXA8c0g8i.png"></li></ul><p></p><ul><li><p><span>弗兰克盖里的自住宅 立面</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuRmUzSgQVaD4jorTMYHwOFibcKv.png"><p></p><ul><li><p><span>弗兰克盖里的自住宅 室内</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs0nuCeC9ZkDeffQO7iynqDdu5dl.png"><ul><li><p><span>弗兰克盖里自住宅手稿</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp8_ePg35jVe8VmT8YHMfB79Tuov.jpg"><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://franklloydwright.org/frank-lloyd-wrights-taliesin/" data-url="https://franklloydwright.org/frank-lloyd-wrights-taliesin/"><span>franklloydwright.org</span></a></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><a href="https://brooklynrail.org/2024/10/architecture/peter-zumthor-with-nile-greenberg/" data-url="https://brooklynrail.org/2024/10/architecture/peter-zumthor-with-nile-greenberg/"><span>brooklynrail.org</span></a></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><a href="https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/master/pnp/habshaer/il/il0300/il0323/data/il0323data.pdf" data-url="https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/master/pnp/habshaer/il/il0300/il0323/data/il0323data.pdf"><span>tile.loc.gov</span></a></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><a href="https://whc.unesco.org/uploads/nominations/1136.pdf" data-url="https://whc.unesco.org/uploads/nominations/1136.pdf"><span>whc.unesco.org</span></a></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><a href="https://www.moma.org/audio/playlist/269/3500" data-url="https://www.moma.org/audio/playlist/269/3500"><span>www.moma.org</span></a></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><a href="https://www.fondationlecorbusier.fr/en/work-architecture/achievements-le-cabanon-roquebrune-cap-martin-france-1951/" data-url="https://www.fondationlecorbusier.fr/en/work-architecture/achievements-le-cabanon-roquebrune-cap-martin-france-1951/"><span>www.fondationlecorbusier.fr</span></a></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><a href="https://www.pinupmagazine.org/articles/frank-gehry-interview" data-url="https://www.pinupmagazine.org/articles/frank-gehry-interview"><span>www.pinupmagazine.org</span></a></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span>：阳仔</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
