  <item>
    <title>没存Vol058_建筑师的城市理想-从山本理显参选说起</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae30a53c96c8942ec143321</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae30a53c96c8942ec143321</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>设计狗</span></strong></p><p><span>大娃 老六</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>内容概要</span></strong></p><p><span>建筑师的建筑理想除了在建筑本身，还能在哪里实践呢？在这一期播客里，我们将从山本理显参选横滨市长切入，讨论建筑师关于城市治理的理想。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 山本理显参与横滨市长竞选的新闻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">08:02</a> 其他建筑师参与城市治理的案例</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 从保田洼第一团地看山本理显的竞选理念</span></p><p></p><ul><li><p><span>熊本县保田洼第一团地</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmgeZC76e2PGV6a5Ofazlg7D5HH3.png"><ul><li><p><span>2012年山本理显在伊东建筑塾分享保田洼第一团地的照片</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi3qTqcMRJOZAYiZMBsbYSmI7vXa.png"><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://note.com/ryujifujimura/n/n08171216ea63" data-url="https://note.com/ryujifujimura/n/n08171216ea63"><span>note.com</span></a></p><p><a href="https://itojuku.or.jp/about/" data-url="https://itojuku.or.jp/about/"><span>itojuku.or.jp</span></a></p><p><a href="https://data.shinkenchiku.online/en/projects/articles/JT_1993_01_136-0" data-url="https://data.shinkenchiku.online/en/projects/articles/JT_1993_01_136-0"><span>data.shinkenchiku.online</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.tozai-as.or.jp/mytech/94/94_yamamoto05.html" data-url="https://www.tozai-as.or.jp/mytech/94/94_yamamoto05.html"><span>www.tozai-as.or.jp</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.10plus1.jp/monthly/2014/09/06.php" data-url="https://www.10plus1.jp/monthly/2014/09/06.php"><span>www.10plus1.jp</span></a></p><p><a href="https://itojuku.or.jp/blog/206" data-url="https://itojuku.or.jp/blog/206"><span>itojuku.or.jp</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.riken-yamamoto.co.jp/index.html?page=ry_proj_detail&amp;id=122&amp;lng=_China" data-url="https://www.riken-yamamoto.co.jp/index.html?page=ry_proj_detail&amp;id=122&amp;lng=_China"><span>www.riken-yamamoto.co.jp</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.archdaily.com/1014067/architecture-classics-hotakubo-housing-riken-yamamoto" data-url="https://www.archdaily.com/1014067/architecture-classics-hotakubo-housing-riken-yamamoto"><span>www.archdaily.com</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.pritzkerprize.com/cn/%E5%B1%8A%E8%8E%B7%E5%A5%96%E8%80%85/shanbenlixian" data-url="https://www.pritzkerprize.com/cn/%E5%B1%8A%E8%8E%B7%E5%A5%96%E8%80%85/shanbenlixian"><span>www.pritzkerprize.com</span></a></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span>：阳仔</span></p>]]></description>
