  <item>
    <title>没存Vol057_建筑师在现今社会中应该扮演什么样的角色——从奥雷·伯曼的一篇访谈讲起</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6acf6081195d838e2af1d1ff</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6acf6081195d838e2af1d1ff</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>设计狗</span></strong></p><p><span>大娃 老六</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>内容概要</span></strong></p><p><span>建筑或建筑师在现今社会中应该扮演什么样的角色？这可能是很多设计师当下都会思考的问题。奥雷·伯曼作为同济大学建筑与城市规划学院教授曾在一个访谈当中阐述了很多他的观点，本期播客与大家共同探讨和分享他的观点与愿景。希望能带给大家一些新的思考。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 奥雷·伯曼是谁，他的理念是什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a> 从一篇访谈来探讨奥雷·伯曼的理念</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="717">11:57</a> 伯曼对于当今建筑的两个判断</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a>什么是 Unsolicited Architecture</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a>更大尺度的目标会让建筑更具有主动性吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1614">26:54</a> 从RIBA的一篇报告来思考未来的建筑方向</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><p><span>Walsh, Niall Patrick. “ ‘Strong Forces Keep Architecture in a Corner’: Ole Bouman Speaks Out on Architecture’s,September28,2026 访谈原文</span><a href="https://archinect.com/features/article/150566653/strong-forces-keep-architecture-in-a-corner-ole-bouman-speaks-out-on-architecture-s-crises" data-url="https://archinect.com/features/article/150566653/strong-forces-keep-architecture-in-a-corner-ole-bouman-speaks-out-on-architecture-s-crises"><span>archinect.com</span></a><span>). Accessed October 5, 2026.</span></p><p></p><p><span>&nbsp;Royal Institute of British Architects. “RIBA AI Report 2026.” </span><em><span>RIBA</span></em><span>, 2026.</span><a href="https://www.riba.org/work/insights-and-resources/ai-report/" data-url="https://www.riba.org/work/insights-and-resources/ai-report/"><span>www.riba.org</span></a><span>. Accessed October 5, 2026.</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/660bec064379e4663d3ea17e/lkT_ssnDXhta9jJYbYlAJ64kZFRJ.m4a" length="32149998" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlotRdXK-C_dCRqDSRjv8az27NiR.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>没存Vol056_城市微型公共设施-从公共厕所说起</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6abccc55e742e36efcbd1f15</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6abccc55e742e36efcbd1f15</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>设计狗</span></strong></p><p><span>大娃 老六</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>内容概要</span></strong></p><p><span>城市的各种微型公共设施是城市公共服务的一个重要的组成部分。在这一期播客里，我们将从日本THE TOKYO TOILET计划出发，讨论城市的微型公共设施如何推动建筑类型的发展，如何建立长期的维护管理机制。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> 东京厕所计划 THE TOKYO TOILET</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> 藤本壮介设计的西参道公厕</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 安藤忠雄设计的神宫通公园公厕</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> THE TOKYO TOILET 的维护</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> 巴黎饮水泉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 高度传播的示范项目能带来建筑类型的提升吗</span></p><p></p><p></p><ul><li><p><span>藤本壮介设计的西参道公厕</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk90lH43ojM0S95CNfam8plrNbKI.jpg"><ul><li><p><span>安藤忠雄设计的神宫通公园公厕</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoTtG8MGpRfYJWkr9-U8jzeE-LJf.png"><ul><li><p><span>THE TOKYO TOILET的工作人员制服</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmPhOQUzG6EbNwkbHEylsumaHHBu.png"><ul><li><p><span>巴黎饮水泉</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftim7fnmh7hdoUPbe2-jr_Z6aBLe.png"><p></p><p></p><p><span>图片来源于网络</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://tokyotoilet.jp/en/" data-url="https://tokyotoilet.jp/en/"><span>tokyotoilet.jp</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.paris.fr/pages/le-saviez-vous-les-fontaines-wallace-sont-une-des-richesses-patrimoniales-de-paris-6560#:~:text=Plus%20d'infos.-,Quelle%20est%20l'origine%20de%20la%20fontaine%20Wallace%20%3F,raisons%20d'hygi%C3%A8ne%20en%201952" data-url="https://www.paris.fr/pages/le-saviez-vous-les-fontaines-wallace-sont-une-des-richesses-patrimoniales-de-paris-6560#:~:text=Plus%20d'infos.-,Quelle%20est%20l'origine%20de%20la%20fontaine%20Wallace%20%3F,raisons%20d'hygi%C3%A8ne%20en%201952"><span>www.paris.fr'infos.-,Quelle%20est%20l'origine%20de%20la%20fontaine%20Wallace%20%3F,raisons%20d'hygi%C3%A8ne%20en%201952</span></a><a href="https://www.paris.fr/pages/le-saviez-vous-les-fontaines-wallace-sont-une-des-richesses-patrimoniales-de-paris-6560#:~:text=Plus%20d'infos.-,Quelle%20est%20l'origine%20de%20la%20fontaine%20Wallace%20%3F,raisons%20d'hygi%C3%A8ne%20en%201952." data-url="https://www.paris.fr/pages/le-saviez-vous-les-fontaines-wallace-sont-une-des-richesses-patrimoniales-de-paris-6560#:~:text=Plus%20d'infos.-,Quelle%20est%20l'origine%20de%20la%20fontaine%20Wallace%20%3F,raisons%20d'hygi%C3%A8ne%20en%201952."><span>.</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.52hrtt.com/kh/n/w/info/D1770703335593" data-url="https://www.52hrtt.com/kh/n/w/info/D1770703335593"><span>www.52hrtt.com</span></a></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span>：阳仔</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
