  <item>
    <title>没存Vol055_建造之后-收缩时代的建筑学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a9e5fe7a0210c197dcec62e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a9e5fe7a0210c197dcec62e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>设计狗</span></strong></p><p><span>大娃 老六</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>内容概要</span></strong></p><p><span>当人口不再增长，建筑学是否还需要不断建造？在这一期播客里，我们将从人口衰退与城市收缩出发，引入城市规划中的“精明收缩”理念，并通过国内外的案例对比，讨论城市如何面对人口减少与空间过剩，重新思考存量时代建筑师的任务。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> 城市收缩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a> 收缩城市与精明收缩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 日本的案例</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">14:25</a> 我国的探索</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 建筑学的类比</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1494">24:54</a> 彩蛋</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><p><span>杜志威，金利霞，张虹鸥。精明收缩理念下城市空置问题的规划响应与启示 —— 基于德国、美国和日本的比较 [J]. 国际城市规划，2020,35 (2):29‑37.DOI:10.19830/j.upi.2020.047</span></p><p><span>Wikipedia：收缩城市</span></p><p><a href="http://ijs.cssn.cn/xsyj/bkwz/202504/t20250417_5869537.shtml" data-url="http://ijs.cssn.cn/xsyj/bkwz/202504/t20250417_5869537.shtml"><span>ijs.cssn.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.mext.go.jp/content/20230331-mxt_sisetujo-000013314_00.pdf" data-url="https://www.mext.go.jp/content/20230331-mxt_sisetujo-000013314_00.pdf"><span>www.mext.go.jp</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.upi-planning.org.cn/Files/hjcsgh/MagazineHtml/202305/gwcg202305009.html#2" data-url="https://www.upi-planning.org.cn/Files/hjcsgh/MagazineHtml/202305/gwcg202305009.html#2"><span>www.upi-planning.org.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://youngstown2030.com/the-youngstown-2010-plan/youngstown-2010-preface/" data-url="https://youngstown2030.com/the-youngstown-2010-plan/youngstown-2010-preface/"><span>youngstown2030.com</span></a></p><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4OTMyNzIzOA==&amp;mid=2650874170&amp;idx=3&amp;sn=56b4b05167e0887e7d6a3b3076103033&amp;poc_token=HILQlmqjGR-b9f5YDstWJacG1j6AiutoY_6uRQ9r" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4OTMyNzIzOA==&amp;mid=2650874170&amp;idx=3&amp;sn=56b4b05167e0887e7d6a3b3076103033&amp;poc_token=HILQlmqjGR-b9f5YDstWJacG1j6AiutoY_6uRQ9r"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span>：阳仔</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
