    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>设计狗</span></strong></p><p><span>大娃 老六</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>内容概要</span></strong></p><p><span>街道的尺度对于行人的行为习惯会产生比较大的影响，也会影响行人对于周边城市意象的建立。在这一期播客里，我们将从芦原义信《街道的美学》出发，和大家一起探索关于街道的尺度的理论发展。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 芦原义信关于街道尺度的研究</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 凯文·林奇的研究</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 简·雅各布斯的研究</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 扬·盖尔的研究</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a> 唐纳德·阿普尔亚德的研究</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1156">19:16</a> 空间句法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> &nbsp;AI能划定出最适合的街道尺度吗</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><p><span>Wikipedia：芦原义信</span></p><p><span>Wikipedia：Kevin A. Lynch</span></p><p><span>Wikipedia：Jane Jacobs</span></p><p><span>Wikipedia：Jan Gehl</span></p><p><span>Wikipedia：Donald Appleyard</span></p><p><span>Wikipedia：Space syntax</span></p><p></p><p><span>《Toward an Urban Design Manifesto》Allan Jacobs and Donald Appleyard</span></p><p><a href="https://townhousecenter.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/02/urban-design-manifesto-by-jacobs-1987.pdf" data-url="https://townhousecenter.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/02/urban-design-manifesto-by-jacobs-1987.pdf"><span>townhousecenter.wordpress.com</span></a></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span>：阳仔</span></p>]]></description>
