  <item>
    <title>没存Vol052_生态恢复-从湿地系统到城市韧性</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a670c25a3fec224d5a40f4f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a670c25a3fec224d5a40f4f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>设计狗</span></strong></p><p><span>大娃 老六</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>内容概要</span></strong></p><p><span>生态恢复是指改善、创造或重建栖息地。它强调的是对水文、土壤、生物等多重过程的重新组织。生态恢复在城市中的意义，在于通过调整空间结构与地表机制，使自然过程重新参与系统运行，从而提升整体调节能力。在这一期播客里，我们将和大家一起探索生态恢复的可能性，它是否能转化为一种面向城市与未来环境的基础性思路。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 什么是生态恢复</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> 盘锦红海滩的生态恢复</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 生态恢复的伦理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 城市内涝之后需要生态恢复吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a> 荷兰的案例</span></p><p></p><ul><li><p><span>盘锦红海滩秋季的景色</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frvj6Rqjufrsw7Nbwy8Cm82m8gUV.png"><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://response.restoration.noaa.gov/remediation-vs-restoration-tale-two-terms#:~:text=Remediation%20is%20the%20process%20of,health%20of%20people%20or%20wildlife" data-url="https://response.restoration.noaa.gov/remediation-vs-restoration-tale-two-terms#:~:text=Remediation%20is%20the%20process%20of,health%20of%20people%20or%20wildlife"><span>response.restoration.noaa.gov</span></a><a href="https://response.restoration.noaa.gov/remediation-vs-restoration-tale-two-terms#:~:text=Remediation%20is%20the%20process%20of,health%20of%20people%20or%20wildlife." data-url="https://response.restoration.noaa.gov/remediation-vs-restoration-tale-two-terms#:~:text=Remediation%20is%20the%20process%20of,health%20of%20people%20or%20wildlife."><span>.</span></a></p><p><span>Society for Ecological Restoration International Science &amp; Policy Working Group. 2004. The SER</span></p><p><span>International Primer on Ecological Restoration. </span><a href="http://www.ser.org" data-url="http://www.ser.org"><span>www.ser.org</span></a><span> &amp; Tucson: Society for Ecological Restoration International.</span></p><p><a href="https://www.nmemc.org.cn/gzdt/201610/t20161012_681736.shtml" data-url="https://www.nmemc.org.cn/gzdt/201610/t20161012_681736.shtml"><span>www.nmemc.org.cn</span></a></p><p><span>王成超，杨玉盛，庞雯，洪静．国外生态旅游对当地社区生计影响研究综述．生态学报，2017,37（16）</span></p><p><a href="https://climatecooperation.cn/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Rotterdam.pdf" data-url="https://climatecooperation.cn/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Rotterdam.pdf"><span>climatecooperation.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.sohu.com/a/478621284_116237" data-url="https://www.sohu.com/a/478621284_116237"><span>www.sohu.com</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.ln.gov.cn/web/zwgkx/jyta/sysj_132760/10DE0CB5D71D4415AF2808612BB567A4/index.shtml" data-url="https://www.ln.gov.cn/web/zwgkx/jyta/sysj_132760/10DE0CB5D71D4415AF2808612BB567A4/index.shtml"><span>www.ln.gov.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.wur.nl/en/news/summer-floods-july-2021-exposed-meuses-vulnerability" data-url="https://www.wur.nl/en/news/summer-floods-july-2021-exposed-meuses-vulnerability"><span>www.wur.nl</span></a></p><p></p><p><span>图片来源于网络</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span>：阳仔</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
