    <title>没存Vol049_存量时代-闲置商务楼宇的重生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1c22d8ac7bdb080c33a2b0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a1c22d8ac7bdb080c33a2b0</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>设计狗</span></strong></p><p><span>大娃 老六</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>内容概要</span></strong></p><p><span>随着存量时代的到来，城市里那些闲置或利用率低的商办楼也逐渐开始显现它们的价值。在这期播客里，我们将和大家聊聊城市里那些闲置的商办空间正在发生的变革。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 什么城市存量空间盘活优化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 上海的商改租实践</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 商务楼宇盘活优化的设计难点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> 商务楼宇盘活优化的其他方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a> 国外的经验</span></p><p></p><ul><li><p><span>上海苏河美欣大厦改造-改造前改造后及原上海制气厂</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FitwW73m4Mh0IqzHN9Kj8KzjaW5h.png"><ul><li><p><span>上海苏河美欣大厦的业态配套</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn3d2u6tOvwnfLKasZKdn8Y7zNtL.png"><ul><li><p><span>武汉的商办改医院实践</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpTiIZrlFisRRRu4Rlp4YlWUAWr3.png"><p></p><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://ghzyj.sh.gov.cn/zcwj/cxgh/20250804/90c43ba26e7f48d3b359851b1dbee491.html" data-url="https://ghzyj.sh.gov.cn/zcwj/cxgh/20250804/90c43ba26e7f48d3b359851b1dbee491.html"><span>ghzyj.sh.gov.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.tfcaijing.com/article/page/594b4645413458534949687a61624d68704f72654d673d3d" data-url="https://www.tfcaijing.com/article/page/594b4645413458534949687a61624d68704f72654d673d3d"><span>www.tfcaijing.com</span></a></p><p><a href="http://www.shfzb.com.cn/shfzb/h5/html5/2025-09/02/content_150503_2581758.htm" data-url="http://www.shfzb.com.cn/shfzb/h5/html5/2025-09/02/content_150503_2581758.htm"><span>www.shfzb.com.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_17594442" data-url="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_17594442"><span>www.thepaper.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://export.shobserver.com/sgh/detail?id=1627437" data-url="https://export.shobserver.com/sgh/detail?id=1627437"><span>export.shobserver.com</span></a></p><p><a href="http://sh.people.com.cn/n2/2025/1018/c134768-41383958.html" data-url="http://sh.people.com.cn/n2/2025/1018/c134768-41383958.html"><span>sh.people.com.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.archiposition.com/items/0dd9897311" data-url="https://www.archiposition.com/items/0dd9897311"><span>www.archiposition.com</span></a></p><p><a href="http://news.cnhubei.com/content/2026-04/22/content_19936827.html" data-url="http://news.cnhubei.com/content/2026-04/22/content_19936827.html"><span>news.cnhubei.com</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.stcn.com/article/detail/3574822.html" data-url="https://www.stcn.com/article/detail/3574822.html"><span>www.stcn.com</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.benoy.com/zh-hans/design-insights/rethinking-urban-centres-the-opportunities-and-challenges-of-converting-empty-office-space/" data-url="https://www.benoy.com/zh-hans/design-insights/rethinking-urban-centres-the-opportunities-and-challenges-of-converting-empty-office-space/"><span>www.benoy.com</span></a></p><p><a href="http://www.zqrb.cn/house/hangyedongtai/2026-05-21/A1779355824088.html" data-url="http://www.zqrb.cn/house/hangyedongtai/2026-05-21/A1779355824088.html"><span>www.zqrb.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://pdf.savills.asia/selected-international-research/2025-china-office-cn-0105.pdf" data-url="https://pdf.savills.asia/selected-international-research/2025-china-office-cn-0105.pdf"><span>pdf.savills.asia</span></a></p><p><span>王乐浔，王润娴，何昊阳，等．城市更新背景下存量商务楼宇的转型与重塑路径——以纽约为例[J]. 南方建筑，2025（12）：</span><a href="http://64-75.WANG" data-url="http://64-75.WANG"><span>64-75.WANG</span></a><span> Lexun,WANG Runxian,HE Haoyang,et al. Toward a Pathway for Office-Building Renewal through Adaptive Reuse: Evidence from New York City, USA[J]. South Architecture, 2025(12): 64-75.</span></p><p><a href="https://schooldesigns.com/Projects/75-morton-street/" da