    <title>没存Vol047_Gentrification士绅化的空间逻辑-城市空间的流动与重组</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f2ff2a9a7ce76acad2d51c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69f2ff2a9a7ce76acad2d51c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>设计狗</span></strong></p><p><span>大娃 老六</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>内容概要</span></strong></p><p><span>Gentrification士绅化，又译为中产阶层化、贵族化，这是城市政治与规划中非常常见且具有争议的一个话题。在这期播客里，我们将从士绅化的发展脉络开始，和大家一起聊聊城市空间的流动与重组。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 什么是士绅化（gentrification）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> 士绅化的原型案例-纽约SOHO街区</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a> 士绅化的其他表现形式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 伦敦金丝雀码头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> 士绅化的争议和讨论</span></p><p></p><ul><li><p><span>纽约SOHO街区的分区规划图</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsFl1g8AFcx5IE6GUXwebB5j6fXC.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>伦敦金丝雀码头1995年和2023年的对比</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlG0bfkynOc3osTV9npXbZYSx4qM.png"></figure><p></p><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://finance.sina.cn/2024-01-25/detail-inaetyty5554062.d.html?vt=4" data-url="https://finance.sina.cn/2024-01-25/detail-inaetyty5554062.d.html?vt=4"><span>finance.sina.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.archdaily.cn/cn/946820/du-shi-shen-shi-hua-xia-zhong-guo-cheng-shi-kong-jian-ji-huo-suo-mian-lin-de-ji-yu-he-tiao-zhan" data-url="https://www.archdaily.cn/cn/946820/du-shi-shen-shi-hua-xia-zhong-guo-cheng-shi-kong-jian-ji-huo-suo-mian-lin-de-ji-yu-he-tiao-zhan"><span>www.archdaily.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_5282694" data-url="https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_5282694"><span>m.thepaper.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://nepaper.ccdy.cn/html/2016-01/24/content_171847.htm" data-url="https://nepaper.ccdy.cn/html/2016-01/24/content_171847.htm"><span>nepaper.ccdy.cn</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.nyc.gov/content/planning/pages/zoning" data-url="https://www.nyc.gov/content/planning/pages/zoning"><span>www.nyc.gov</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.nyc.gov/assets/planning/downloads/pdf/our-work/plans/manhattan/soho-noho-neighborhood-plan/summary-adopted-cc-121521.pdf" data-url="https://www.nyc.gov/assets/planning/downloads/pdf/our-work/plans/manhattan/soho-noho-neighborhood-plan/summary-adopted-cc-121521.pdf"><span>www.nyc.gov</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.nyc.gov/content/planning/pages/zoning/zoning-districts-guide/manufacturing-districts" data-url="https://www.nyc.gov/content/planning/pages/zoning/zoning-districts-guide/manufacturing-districts"><span>www.nyc.gov</span></a></p><p><span>Wikipedia：SoHo, Manhattan</span></p><p><span>Wikipedia：gentrification</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span>图片来源于网络</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span>：阳仔</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
