  <item>
    <title>没存Vol046_TOD三十年-一种城市理想</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d0e43eb977fb2c471751e7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d0e43eb977fb2c471751e7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 Apr 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>设计狗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大娃 老六</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容概要</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>TOD（以公共交通为导向的发展）是一种最具代表性的城市社区开发模式，目前也在世界各地被广泛应用。在这期播客里，我们将从不同国家地区对于TOD模式的实践，聊聊这一模式从理论提出到全球实践的演变路径。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a>什么是TOD</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a> 日本的TOD</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 香港的TOD</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 大陆的TOD</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>涩谷站周边的人行动线</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FooyC7y2IZGwggBoi2LCqXB4mxCT.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>涩谷之光和涩谷站大厦的“城市核(urban core)”剖面</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoEeNy0BsqUNJWTFUW_4h9zxG8cd.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>未来的涩谷站剖面</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoFFRpXiRA-an7t-kiUo-fuKMJ90.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="http://www.archina.com/index.php?g=press&amp;m=index&amp;a=show&amp;id=4378" data-url="http://www.archina.com/index.php?g=press&amp;m=index&amp;a=show&amp;id=4378"><span>www.archina.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://www.archina.com/index.php?g=ela&amp;m=index&amp;a=show&amp;id=4352" data-url="http://www.archina.com/index.php?g=ela&amp;m=index&amp;a=show&amp;id=4352"><span>www.archina.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.archdaily.cn/cn/1027898/bu-jin-shi-jiao-tong-zhan-dian-tan-suo-dong-ya-tod-de-fa-zhan-yan-bian" data-url="https://www.archdaily.cn/cn/1027898/bu-jin-shi-jiao-tong-zhan-dian-tan-suo-dong-ya-tod-de-fa-zhan-yan-bian"><span>www.archdaily.cn</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.jzda001.com/index/index/details?type=1&amp;id=6724" data-url="https://www.jzda001.com/index/index/details?type=1&amp;id=6724"><span>www.jzda001.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.archiposition.com/items/20210520103956" data-url="https://www.archiposition.com/items/20210520103956"><span>www.archiposition.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.ur.org.tw/classroom/view/196" data-url="https://www.ur.org.tw/classroom/view/196"><span>www.ur.org.tw</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.nikken.co.jp/cn/insights/shibuya1.html" data-url="https://www.nikken.co.jp/cn/insights/shibuya1.html"><span>www.nikken.co.jp</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.ur.org.tw/classroom/view/195" data-url="https://www.ur.org.tw/classroom/view/195"><span>www.ur.org.tw</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://sghexport.shobserver.com/html/baijiahao/2022/04/19/718217.html" data-url="https://sghexport.shobserver.com/html/baijiahao/2022/04/19/718217.html"><span>sghexport.shobserver.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>甘博. 日本轨道交通TOD实践发展历程及启示[J]. 现代城市轨道交通, 2025(04): 108-112.</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片来源于网络</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span>：阳仔</span></p>]]></description>
