  <item>
    <title>没存Vol045_消极与积极的消费空间-非标商业vs大盒子商业</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ca7366e2c8be3155eb3feb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ca7366e2c8be3155eb3feb</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Apr 2026 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>设计狗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大娃 老六</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容概要</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>由于最近一直在做商业空间的设计，所以有一些小小的心得想与大家分享。在本期播客中与大家探讨一下我自己定义的“积极型消费空间”与“消极型消费空间”的区别，以及他们各自的优劣势。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a>商业空间的趋势——非标商业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a>什么是“积极型消费空间”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a>什么是“消极型消费空间”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a>极致的积极型消费空间Emsphere</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1007">16:47</a>不以促成交易为目的的消极型消费空间麓湖cpi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a>商业是否应该回归促成交易的本质</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Victor Gruen</span></p><span></span><p><span>Architect of an American Icon</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.archive.austria.org/victor-gruen" data-url="https://www.archive.austria.org/victor-gruen"><span>www.archive.austria.org</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>the architect as creator ofenvironments: VICTOR GRUEN, VISIONARY PIONEER OF URBAN REVITALIZATIONS</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.collectionscanada.gc.ca/obj/s4/f2/dsk2/ftp04/mq22107.pdf" data-url="https://www.collectionscanada.gc.ca/obj/s4/f2/dsk2/ftp04/mq22107.pdf"><span>www.collectionscanada.gc.ca</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Naked City: The Death and Life of AuthenticUrban Places — Sharon Zukin</span></p><span></span><p><span>Enchanting a Disenchanted World:Revolutionizing the Means of Consumption — George Ritzer</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span>：阳仔</span></p>]]></description>
